and code words.\nPreserve each actor, pronoun, attribution, named object, action, condition, quantity, date, question, negation, uncertainty, and requested or forbidden action. Do not switch you/I/he, convert a question or dialogue request into narration, invent an event, or remove valid manner/context details. Names, titles, code, paths, numbers and dates retain their source spelling. Relevant spelling edits have already been explicitly applied where supported; do not guess further entity spellings.\nImprove punctuation, spacing and clearly supported grammar/function-word inflections. Remove meaningless hesitation and genuine repetition, retaining meaningful opinion and politeness. If a source word or fragment is unclear, keep its wording rather than substituting a guessed action/name or completing an unseen clause. Do not modernize literary dialect or infer missing facts. Distinct exclusions and contrasts must remain, even if a value also implies them. Only an explicit withdrawal/correction cue permits removing the obsolete value. No completion claims, invented requirements, headings or signatures. Return only the edited source text in its original language(s).\nEdit the complete work message, including all background and status statements, not only the tasks. Keep each owner with their own task and individually attached deadline. A time or condition shared by several tasks stays in a separate sentence applying to all; never narrow its scope or treat individual deadlines as shared. Use grammatical sentences and optional bullets for independent tasks. Do not invent an owner, omit a status because a task implies it, or turn an ongoing action into a completed one. Remove a genuine repeated oral restart once; retain repetition that describes different actions or quoted words. Preserve all restrictions and uncertainty.\nFor the FINAL input, preserve each phrase in its existing language, including mixed Han/Latin text and code. Do not translate the whole text into either language. Only copyedit the source.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"先核对 syncQueue，暂时不要动权限。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n先核对 syncQueue，暂时不要动权限。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"小方整理材料，小卢复核，材料周二交，复核周五完成。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- 小方整理材料，周二交。\n- 小卢复核，周五完成。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"Mina owns design and Owen handles testing. Design is due Tuesday and testing Friday.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- Mina owns design, due Tuesday.\n- Owen handles testing, due Friday.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"fetchCash 的记录，fetchCash 的记录先核对，暂时不要动权限。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n先核对 fetchCash 的记录，暂时不要动权限。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"我说的 sailBoat 是帆船，不是卖船，暂时不要动。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n我说的 sailBoat 是帆船，不是卖船，暂时不要动。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"The audit is complete, packing is still in progress, Noor handles packing, Devin checks labels, contact the courier after both checks finish.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nThe audit is complete. Packing is still in progress.\n\n- Noor handles packing.\n- Devin checks labels.\n\nContact the courier after both checks finish.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"盘点结束了，装箱还在进行，小岑负责装箱，小佟检查标签，都检查完再联系承运方。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n盘点结束了，装箱还在进行。\n\n- 小岑负责装箱。\n- 小佟检查标签。\n\n都检查完再联系承运方。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"Jules checks inventory and Morgan packs the orders, begin Monday afternoon and ship only after inspection clears.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- Jules checks inventory.\n- Morgan packs the orders.\n\nBegin Monday afternoon and ship only after inspection clears.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"小陆核对账目，小何整理凭证，下周一开始，双方确认后再提交。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- 小陆核对账目。\n- 小何整理凭证。\n\n下周一开始，双方确认后再提交。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"这份清单，这份清单先核对一下，确认前别发送。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n先核对这份清单，确认前别发送。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"给 pullCache 加日志，不记查询内容，别改过期策略。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
