r language. Only copyedit the source.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"先核对 syncQueue，暂时不要动权限。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n先核对 syncQueue，暂时不要动权限。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"小方整理材料，小卢复核，材料周二交，复核周五完成。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- 小方整理材料，周二交。\n- 小卢复核，周五完成。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"Mina owns design and Owen handles testing. Design is due Tuesday and testing Friday.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- Mina owns design, due Tuesday.\n- Owen handles testing, due Friday.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"fetchCash 的记录，fetchCash 的记录先核对，暂时不要动权限。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n先核对 fetchCash 的记录，暂时不要动权限。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"我说的 sailBoat 是帆船，不是卖船，暂时不要动。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n我说的 sailBoat 是帆船，不是卖船，暂时不要动。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"The audit is complete, packing is still in progress, Noor handles packing, Devin checks labels, contact the courier after both checks finish.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nThe audit is complete. Packing is still in progress.\n\n- Noor handles packing.\n- Devin checks labels.\n\nContact the courier after both checks finish.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"盘点结束了，装箱还在进行，小岑负责装箱，小佟检查标签，都检查完再联系承运方。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n盘点结束了，装箱还在进行。\n\n- 小岑负责装箱。\n- 小佟检查标签。\n\n都检查完再联系承运方。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"Jules checks inventory and Morgan packs the orders, begin Monday afternoon and ship only after inspection clears.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- Jules checks inventory.\n- Morgan packs the orders.\n\nBegin Monday afternoon and ship only after inspection clears.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"小陆核对账目，小何整理凭证，下周一开始，双方确认后再提交。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- 小陆核对账目。\n- 小何整理凭证。\n\n下周一开始，双方确认后再提交。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"这份清单，这份清单先核对一下，确认前别发送。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n先核对这份清单，确认前别发送。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"readCash 的日志，readCash 的日志先查一下，先别改配置。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
