les checks inventory.\n- Morgan packs the orders.\n\nBegin Monday afternoon and ship only after inspection clears.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"小陆核对账目，小何整理凭证，下周一开始，双方确认后再提交。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- 小陆核对账目。\n- 小何整理凭证。\n\n下周一开始，双方确认后再提交。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"这份清单，这份清单先核对一下，确认前别发送。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n先核对这份清单，确认前别发送。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"同步服务恢复了，replayJob 还在跑，小夏周二核对结果，小芮周四更新 README.md，确认两项完成后再通知，不改 replayJob。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
